      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Ashbound Survivors.</em></p><p><strong>“You don’t conquer the wasteland. You outlast it.”</strong></p><p>Ashbound Survivors know how to live where maps stop pretending. They ration breath, read heat shimmer like scripture, and treat hostile terrain as a negotiation instead of a death sentence.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Athletics and Lore.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your Domain earns <strong>+10 Economy</strong> marks each turn while you serve it.</li></ul>",
